  WRONG   What was Voss Industrial's revenue in 2025?            got [(None,)]  want [(4323725.42,)]
  WRONG   Which supplier has the most products?                  got [('Pemberton Mills', 6  want [('Quillon Metals',)]
  WRONG   How many suppliers are based outside the United Stat   got [(20,)]  want [(10,)]

20 questions
  ran without error   20/20  100%
  returned the right answer 17/20  85%

Every query that ran, ran silently. A wrong number and a right number come back
through the same code path, in the same shape, with no indication which is which.

This is the accuracy people demo, and it is measured here against a reference
query rather than by reading the SQL and nodding — which is the only reason we
know it is not 100%.
